      "created_at": "2013-02-25T13:36:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>To add to the discussion, once you skip your turn for one card, your turn immediately ends. No draw, no end of turn triggers. You don't have another turn to skip immediately after you decide to skip for one effect.</p>",
